  "ingredients": [
    "1.25 pounds Yukon Gold potatoes, peeled and cubed",
    "3 cloves garlic, halved",
    "1 pound lean ground beef",
    "2 tablespoons flour",
    "4 cups frozen mixed vegetables",
    "0.75 cup beef broth",
    "3 tablespoons ketchup",
    "1 teaspoon salt",
    "0.5 teaspoon black pepper",
    "0.75 cup light sour cream",
    "0.5 cup shredded Cheddar cheese, divided"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Place cubed potatoes and garlic in a large pot with enough water to cover; bring to a boil. Reduce heat to medium-low, cover, and simmer until tender, about 20 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/wS40gnJH-ilhlZn3z6Wq-nE0T0Y=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/219919-chef-johns-shepherds-pie-PICS-Step-01-084b758642ce4aa9a59afa76aa339743.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/219919/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C). Meanwhile, cook ground beef in a skillet over medium heat. Stir flour into beef and drippings; stir in vegetables, beef broth, ketchup, salt, and black pepper until combined. Cook until thick, about 5 minutes, then transfer to an oven-proof casserole dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/spQZPA_Iiip6x7NboROi2-9TSJY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/219919-chef-johns-shepherds-pie-PICS-Step-02-fa35b5ebee65490f84f0a4374c56c69c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/219919/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Drain potatoes and garlic; return them to the pot. Slightly smash potatoes and garlic with a potato masher; add sour cream and 1/4 cup Cheddar cheese. Mash until smooth.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/wmANcJZZHNMJwROuDpfiKymiuao=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/219919-chef-johns-shepherds-pie-PICS-Step-03-598f1a36aeac40f58cec58ad395ff349.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/219919/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Top beef mixture with potatoes, spreading from center of casserole to edges to form top layer. Sprinkle with remaining 1/4 cup Cheddar cheese.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/xe8Al6pSAA0AjUgzI4GlKf3-n2w=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/219919-chef-johns-shepherds-pie-PICS-Step-04-82ca4c2e5461484f9df2ecae1a0eb37e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/219919/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until cheese melts and turns golden, 20 to 25 minutes. Cool before serving, 15 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/M2JkfivIu9chaGGpUePIckg_F80=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/219919-chef-johns-shepherds-pie-PICS-Step-05-f9e820a8debc4b22b088a45aa53771bb.jpg"
      ],
